    {
      "id": "b1d469ce-1853-409f-b040-6760a86df58f",
      "name": "About",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        -260
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 520,
        "height": 460,
        "color": 4,
        "content": "## 39 · AI Transcription Automation\nTranscribes audio from a URL with OpenAI Whisper, then summarises it and extracts action items.\n\n**Trigger:** `POST /webhook/transcription` (JSON body)\n\n**Setup**\n1. Edit the **Config** node (model, sheet URL, endpoints).\n2. Connect credentials: Google Sheets OAuth2, OpenAI API, Slack.\n3. Pick Slack channels / sheet tabs on the action nodes.\n4. Activate.\n\n**Sample payload:**\n```json\n{\n \"audioUrl\": \"https://example.com/recording.mp3\",\n \"title\": \"Client call\"\n}\n```"
      }
    }
  ],
